1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20051208011023.jpg
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter's confirmation.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20050902010549.jpg
2 CONT
2 CONT Tollak and Johanne celebrated their Golden Wedding Anniversary 17th of May in 1933. Tollak Belongs to an old family who has lived at Havsoy for many generations. He has run the farm for 50 years and now at the age of 82 he is stil
2 CONC l much in control. His father Sivert built a small 3 stone mill on the Eie river, and during milling seasons the mill ran day and night. Even as a school boy Tollak had to take his turn at the mill, and later it all became his. Jo
2 CONC hanne 69 yrs. old is the daughter of the famous Svanes Pilot, Nils Karlsen. Together they have 12 children and 11 are still alive. They have 37 grand-children.   
