1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob Andreas Michelsen (17 August 1821 – 1902) was a Norwegian businessperson and politician, also known as the father of Christian Michelsen.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Tollach Michelsen, a manual laborer with roots in the Egersund district. Tollach's wife Madsi Magdalena Eide (died 1829) came from the same social background.
2 CONT
