1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lian Lyngdal I 181.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. G. T. Gunderson died Thursday, Dec. 16, at his late residence on Ashland avenue, at the advanced age of 79 years. He was born June 18, 1807, in a little hamlet called Skralea, in the Kingdom of Norway, where he was married and
2 CONC  four of his children were born. He started for the New World May 17, 1848. He landed in New York with only 25 cents in money, but he managed to come to Chicago in October of the same year. He has been engaged in active business h
2 CONC ere since that time, and was well-to-do financially at the time of his death. Mr. Gunderson was a devout member of the Norwegian Evangelical Lutheran Church. He leaves four sons, all of whom are married and living in Chicago. Dail
2 CONC y Inter Ocean (Chicago, Illinois) December 19, 1886 https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/76478294/gunder-tobias-gunderson
2 CONT --------------------
