2 CONT Mariage 4 mars 1834 Hidra sogn-line 4-http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20060103050906.jpg
2 CONT
2 CONT "My Great Great Great Grandfather Salve Nilsen Bakke (son of Nils Salvesen) was born on the Bakke farm near Flekkefjord, Norway. His son my Great Great Grandfather Salve Salvesen was one of the early settlers in Door County, Wisco
2 CONC nsin of the USA. Salve Salvesen & family sailed on the Ebenezer from Stavanger in 1851. Prior to a project completed by Legacy Tree my family knew nothing about Salve Salveson & family other than they sailed from Stavanger.  My fa
2 CONC mily still owns the settlement property on the shores of Sturgeon Bay a short distance north of the City of Sturgeon Bay, Wisconsin. (www.theshore.org)  On September 28th I will arrive in Oslo, Norway and following a couple days i
2 CONC n Oslo I plan to travel to the Flekkefjord area, the location of the ancestral farms (Bakke, Mandal, Skailand, Loga, Stodrange, Mjasund & Birkeland) and Stavanger.  I look forward to visiting the Flekkefjord Museum and the area in
2 CONC  general. If you have any advice or guidance to aid in my visit I would appreciate a response from you.  I have attached a portion of a family research report that Legacy Tree completed for me.  Thank you.  William Schuster  Door 
2 CONC County, Wisconsin  USA"
