2 CONC : #000000;" data-start="692" data-end="1248">The farm of Hafso has now been incorporated into the town of Egersund, so the farm is just about built over. I was the oldest child of twelve, six boys and six girls. Brother Johan died
2 CONC  in December 1907, seventeen years old. He died from diphtheria, and we lost a sister, Amanda Filing. She died in 1938 after the seventh child was born. She left a husband and seven children (six boys and one girl). I, Sivert, was
2 CONC  named after my grandfather and grandmother. Their names were Sivert and Ingeborg. The family had been using Sivert and Carl for a long time.≤/p>xt-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing
2 CONC : 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000;" data-start="1250" data-end="1565">In 1945, my sister Tyra got what was left of the farm after the death of our dad. The farm by r
2 CONC ight belonged to me, and I had bought half the farm in 1908 when I was at home. ≤spanstyle="font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0p
2 CONC x; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-size: medium; float: none; display: inline !important
