2 CONC 300">Going back to our wedding in Edmonton, the wedding was held at Mr. &amp; Mrs. Lokken&rsquo;s place, and the whole settlement&mdash;probably about ten families&mdash;were invited. We got a lot of presents. There was a full hou
2 CONC se that day. We went back to my homestead which was only two miles north from Mr. Lokken&rsquo;s. There I had built a frame house with a living room and a bedroom.≤/p>o; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; w
