2 CONC spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000;" data-start="3748" data-end="4055">The family in 1925 was eight children and Mother and Dad. By this time, I was pretty wel
2 CONC l fixed and decided to take the trip to Norway. I got a hold of a good woman to look after the children, and we had a man who had been with us ten years at that time&mdash;a very dependable person by the name of Carl Carlson.≤/p>g
