2 CONC 000000; color: #000000;" data-start="4057" data-end="4393">We started for Norway in December with the two youngest children&mdash;Arnold (2 years) and Edith (4 years). It was a memorable vacation, the first time Mother had seen he
2 CONC r sisters and brothers in sixteen years. During the winter, we discovered there were some more children coming, so we had to go back home again earlier than we figured on.≤/p>xt-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; 
