2 CONC  the earliest members of the Hafso family to immigrate from ≤strong data-start="469" data-end="489">Egersund, Norway≤/strong>, to ≤strongdata-start="494" data-end="504">Canada≤/strong>, likely arriving before 1911. He settled in t
2 CONC he ≤strong data-start="553" data-end="572">Viking, Alberta≤/strong> area and helped establish a strong farming presence there. Sivert and his wife ≤strong data-start="652" data-end="662">Hannah≤/strong> raised a large family of ≤s
