2 CONT ≤p style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px Helvetica;">TOLLAK HAFSO FAMILY≤/p>.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px Helvetica;">Tollak Hafso came from Egersund, Norway in≤/p>orked in lumber camps. He also worked for fa
2 CONC rmers in the Viking area before settling down on his homestead, north of Maple Lodge School.≤/p>lvetica;">Tollak married Clara Hjelsvold. Clara came from Sioux Falls, South Dakota with her parents in 1905. They came by train to We
2 CONC taskiwin and then by team and wagon to Viking.≤/p>in: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px Helvetica;">Tollak and Clara had nine children. Henry lives in Viking. Velma married Joe McCarthy. Velma worked at Simpson's Store in Edmo
2 CONC nton for many years.Joe passed away in 1986. Velma is now living on a farm near Tofield with her brother Borden and family.≤/p>rie Smith. Thorlief was a fireman. Marje worked at Simpson's Store for many years. Thor and Marje now l
2 CONC ive at Alberta Beach. They have two children. Barbara, a secre-tary, married Dave Irvine, a pipeline construction contractor. They live in Edmonton and have two girls, Daneen and Tammy. Phyllis, a secretary, married Terry Ledingha
2 CONC m, an electrician. They live at Bon Accord and have two children, Kathleen and Timothy.≤/p>"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.0px Helvetica;">Robert, who works for Edmonton Telephones, married Belinda Elko. They have two c
2 CONC hildren, Lyndsey and Tyler. Sheri married Jack Hill, a buyer for Woodward's Department Store. Sheri has a craft and gift shop in Callingwood Mall. They live in Edmonton and have two children, Scott and Keltie.≤/p>t: 12.0px Helveti
2 CONC ca;">Ruby married Art McNalley. Art passed away in 1974. They ran a store in Wildwood. They had two children, Lisa and Terry, who still live in Wild-wood. In 1981, Ruby married Cecil Rowden and lived in Red Deer. Ruby passed away 
2 CONC in 1982.≤/p>, married Linda and they have three children, Sheila, Shelly and Tom. Petra married a miner, Bill Bailey. They live at Osbourne, Idaho and have three girls - Kressi, Toya and Natalie. John (Tiger) married Wendy and has
2 CONC  two children. He lives in Reno, Nevada.≤/p>font: 12.0px Helvetica;">Mannering. Noble≤/p>ildren and grandchildren live near Woodland, Washington.≤/p>0.0px; font: 12.0px Helvetica;">They live at≤/p>nt: 12.0px Helvetica;">Borden mar
2 CONC ried Winnie Sanderson. They have four children. Debbie has three children - Cather-ine, Stephanie and Christopher and they live in Delta, B.C. Marlene married Ron Malizewski and lives in Delta, B.C. She has two children - Todd and
2 CONC  Sherry. Darlene married Keith Gibb and has two boys - Keith and Chadd. They live at the U.S.≤/p>0px; font: 12.0px Helvetica;">Airforce Base near Frankfurt, Germany. Ira is living at home with his parents near Tofield, Alberta.≤/p
2 CONC >a;">Tollak and Clara lived on the farm until 1949.≤/p>th Edmonton for a few more years, then moved to the Norwood Golden Manor. In March 1987 she moved to Vialta Lodge, Viking and is now residing at Extendicare.≤/p>.0px; font: 12
2 CONC .0px Helvetica;">Clara will be ninety-six years in December 1990 and still remembers much about the oldtimers of Viking. She is always happy to have people visit her and talk about the "good old days"≤/p>ica;">a reunion at Vern Ha
2 CONC fso's farm.≤/p>
